Package: scART
Type: Package
Title: Single Cell Analysis of Readthrough Transcription
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person(
      "Neil", "Shende",
      email = "nshende@ucsd.edu",
      role = c("aut", "cre")
    )
  )
Description: Tool for analyzing readthrough transcription in single cell RNA sequencing data
    Exports three functions
    ReadthrougGTF takes a gtf file as input, and exports a gtf file that annotates readthrough regions
    AddReadthroughAssay adds an assay for readthrough information to a seurat object
    GeneReadthrough calculates gene readthrough levels from a seurat object with a readthrough assay
License: MIT
Encoding: UTF-8
LazyData: true
RoxygenNote: 7.3.3
